  <spirit:description>Jordanov-Knoll recursive trapezoidal filter, the spectroscopy energy channel (replaces psd_core&apos;s former single-sample raw-peak estimate). Consumes the framed trace from trigger_core, produces a shaped-pulse plateau AMPLITUDE per event, tagged with the 64-bit TUSER timestamp, buffered in a result FIFO readable over AXI4-Lite with a watermark interrupt. Never backpressures the stream. AXI4-Lite: peaking (0x00), flat_top (0x04), decay (0x08), enable (0x0C), ctrl (0x10), status (0x14), amplitude (0x18), timestamp (0x1C-0x20), event_count (0x24), watermark (0x28).</spirit:description>
